The 7z and ZIPX fixtures in this directory were generated for SwiftArchive's
test suite from project-owned test payloads. They may be used, copied,
modified, and redistributed without restriction.

7z fixtures were generated with 7-Zip 26.02 using these representative modes:

- Content encryption: -popen-sesame -mhe=off -ms=on
- Header encryption: -popen-sesame -mhe=on -ms=on
- Unicode password: -p密碼-🔐 -mhe=on
- Split archives: -v64b

ZIPX fixtures other than `zipx-zstd.zipx` and `zipx-xz.zipx` were generated
with 7-Zip 26.02 by forcing the compression method named in each filename.
The two exceptions are attributed to libarchive in `FIXTURES.md`, which also
records representative commands and hashes.
